WEBVTT

00:11.080 --> 00:16.240
The Rosenberg Knights' Academy Graduation Tournament is nearly at its end.

00:16.240 --> 00:19.080
Is everyone excited about it?!

00:21.080 --> 00:25.130
We have invited a special guest to judge the final round,

00:25.130 --> 00:29.910
Sir Judas, commander of Viella's Tempelritter.

00:33.170 --> 00:35.910
The ones who will fight for the
honorable title of Royal Knight are...

00:35.910 --> 00:39.090
the young knight who once defeated an Angel, Hyaweh,

00:39.090 --> 00:42.850
and the lovely female knight, Priecia.

00:49.370 --> 00:51.220
Onii-chan?

00:51.220 --> 00:52.610
Hey, Onii-chan!

00:55.150 --> 00:57.660
It's almost your turn, Hyaweh.

00:57.960 --> 00:59.170
I know.

00:59.170 --> 01:00.680
Onii-chan.

01:06.970 --> 01:10.550
I know Priecia-san seized a kiss from you last time,

01:10.550 --> 01:15.550
but there's no way she'll be kissed by the Goddess of Victory in this match.

01:16.480 --> 01:18.050
Filia...

01:20.470 --> 01:23.310
The time has arrived, Lady Priecia.

01:23.750 --> 01:24.560
Yes.

01:24.940 --> 01:26.120
Hyaweh.

01:26.120 --> 01:27.650
Priecia.

01:27.650 --> 01:29.260
It's finally time...

01:29.260 --> 01:30.600
...for us to decide...

01:30.600 --> 01:32.610
...which one of us is stronger.

01:33.840 --> 01:36.190
The final match will now begin!

01:36.190 --> 01:40.060
The title of Royal Knight will be conferred onto the winner of this contest.

01:40.060 --> 01:45.620
It's my hope that you both utilize your abilities to their fullest and have no regrets.

01:45.970 --> 01:50.820
When it comes to abilities,
Priecia has the upper hand in this match.

01:50.820 --> 01:52.250
I see.

01:52.250 --> 01:56.950
However, Hyaweh is the one who defeated an Angel.

01:56.950 --> 01:59.550
Besides, he has that sword.

01:59.550 --> 02:01.260
Am I right, Ms. Litte?

02:01.260 --> 02:03.260
Y-Yes.

02:11.810 --> 02:15.570
<i>Hyaweh, I will defeat you!</i>

02:16.370 --> 02:20.820
<i>After that, I have something to tell you.</i>

02:23.700 --> 02:27.000
The Knights' Ark

02:28.150 --> 02:30.000
So help me, Lelihion...

02:30.630 --> 02:32.780
and in the name of the Royal Knights,

02:32.780 --> 02:39.760
we hereby swear not to tarnish the reputation of the Rosenberg Knights' Academy.

02:47.350 --> 02:50.060
Congratulations, everyone. You have graduated.

02:50.420 --> 02:55.110
You all have now become certified Knights of Windland.

02:55.110 --> 02:59.110
After this, many of you will be dispatched to Sablum.

02:59.960 --> 03:02.870
You will be separated from your schoolmates,

03:02.870 --> 03:04.620
and may be wounded in fierce battles.

03:05.010 --> 03:07.120
Some of you may even lose your lives.

03:07.120 --> 03:09.620
Those who survive must someday face death.

03:09.950 --> 03:12.630
However, as knights, we will not fear death.

03:13.150 --> 03:18.060
For as knights, our spirit and pride are eternal and undying.

03:18.060 --> 03:21.630
Yes, you and your spirits...

03:22.240 --> 03:24.640
are immortal!

03:30.530 --> 03:35.240
Fel, you have been assigned to the 13th Special Sorcery Squad.

03:35.240 --> 03:39.020
Even though it's a squad filled with young magic-users,

03:39.020 --> 03:41.200
it's quite strong.

03:41.470 --> 03:45.690
Yes, I'll work hard and make sure I don't slow my seniors down.

03:45.990 --> 03:48.420
Next, Bridget...

03:48.420 --> 03:51.460
Whoa, you've been assigned to the 6th Information Squad.

03:51.460 --> 03:56.840
This is amazing. People with normal
grades are unable to get in there.

03:56.840 --> 04:02.130
Take it. For the good of Windland, please observe Sablum well.

04:02.130 --> 04:04.510
I'll do whatever I can.

04:04.780 --> 04:06.180
Hyaweh.

04:07.780 --> 04:08.510
Y-Yes?

04:10.010 --> 04:13.740
I understand you must be upset about your defeat in the Royal Knight match.

04:13.740 --> 04:14.840
But if you stay that way,

04:14.840 --> 04:18.520
your companions in the Tempelritter will make fun of you.

04:19.480 --> 04:21.970
I've been assigned to the Tempelritter?

04:21.970 --> 04:27.220
Yes. Sir Judas specifically requested you after watching yesterday's match.

04:28.700 --> 04:31.830
Next, Ayra, Orichi and Massie...

04:31.830 --> 04:36.290
you need to go to the retraining camp to retrain yourselves.

04:36.290 --> 04:38.210
Yes, ma'am...

04:38.790 --> 04:42.800
Hyaweh, I have something to tell you and only you.

04:43.680 --> 04:45.000
Priecia...

04:51.290 --> 04:55.820
It's fantastic! That match was incredible, Priecia!

04:55.820 --> 04:57.620
Thank you.

04:57.620 --> 05:01.320
During the Royal Knight conferment ceremony at today's graduation party,

05:01.320 --> 05:07.500
please identify and proclaim yourself as the Queen of Windland.

05:07.500 --> 05:08.830
Very well.

05:09.090 --> 05:12.800
Why are you looking so gloomy? You will go on stage soon.

05:12.800 --> 05:14.710
Are you feeling sick?

05:14.710 --> 05:17.080
Are you tired, Lady Priecia?

05:17.080 --> 05:20.550
Are you worrying about Hyaweh?

05:21.610 --> 05:22.620
He guessed right?

05:22.620 --> 05:26.190
T-There's no reason for me to worry about such a man!

05:26.190 --> 05:30.350
You don't need to conceal it. You love him, don't you?

05:30.350 --> 05:34.250
Stop talking about that. Even if I did, I...

05:34.560 --> 05:40.270
After tonight, I'll no longer be the me he fell in love with.

05:40.770 --> 05:42.600
Indeed, that is so.

05:42.600 --> 05:46.860
But what do <i>you</i> want to do, Priecia?

05:46.860 --> 05:53.900
You have been destined to be the Queen of Windland ever since you were born.

05:53.900 --> 05:57.620
Your past is something you can't change.

05:57.620 --> 06:00.880
However, the future is still unknown.

06:00.880 --> 06:04.890
And the two of you can forge your own paths.

06:04.890 --> 06:06.640
Don't forget about this.

06:07.230 --> 06:11.300
Tonight is your last chance, so don't let it slip by.

06:15.870 --> 06:19.770
Do you love Hyaweh, Lady Priecia?

06:19.770 --> 06:21.770
Y... Yes...

06:37.390 --> 06:39.700
Priecia isn't here yet?

06:45.400 --> 06:47.050
Sir Judas...

06:47.330 --> 06:49.800
M-My apologies!

06:50.800 --> 06:54.810
Hyaweh, how could you be so rude to Sir Judas?

06:54.810 --> 06:56.820
Are you Hyaweh?

06:58.310 --> 06:59.850
I've wanted to meet you.

07:00.210 --> 07:03.860
You put up a valiant fight in yesterday's match.

07:03.860 --> 07:06.360
T-Thank you.

07:11.190 --> 07:14.990
You are the one I've been seeking for so long.

07:15.930 --> 07:19.410
You have a talent that most others lack.

07:20.000 --> 07:24.920
As my knight, please use your power to the fullest.

07:25.880 --> 07:28.760
I'm... going to be your knight?

07:28.760 --> 07:31.670
Sir Judas, I beg your pardon.

07:32.090 --> 07:34.610
That person seems to have offended you.

07:34.610 --> 07:37.720
As the student representative, I must make amends.

07:38.120 --> 07:40.420
It's not a big deal.

07:40.420 --> 07:42.980
Please raise your head, Priecia.

07:43.620 --> 07:46.430
I appreciate your leniency.

07:46.430 --> 07:50.670
I'll teach this guy not to repeat this sort of unmannered conduct.

07:50.670 --> 07:52.090
So, Sir...

07:52.860 --> 07:54.120
If you'll excuse us!

08:00.480 --> 08:02.170
Sir Judas?

08:03.210 --> 08:05.310
T-Thank you, Priecia.

08:05.310 --> 08:06.170
For what?

08:06.560 --> 08:09.130
Um, for... saving me?

08:09.610 --> 08:11.170
Sorry.

08:11.170 --> 08:13.220
Why are you apologizing?

08:13.220 --> 08:19.870
Why do guys like you always become
so timid whenever we're alone?

08:19.870 --> 08:23.360
I really hate that part of you!

08:23.360 --> 08:24.640
Priecia.

08:25.930 --> 08:27.350
You're very beautiful.

08:28.400 --> 08:31.740
Only because I'm wearing this dress, right?

08:31.740 --> 08:35.820
S-Sure, the dress looks nice,
but you look more beautiful today than—

08:36.800 --> 08:38.490
Well, you always look good...

08:39.180 --> 08:40.890
But, you're even prettier today.

08:41.610 --> 08:43.000
You're just like the rest.

08:43.920 --> 08:47.050
You'd rather have a girl like the princess in that play.

08:47.050 --> 08:51.550
You'd prefer a girl who's always dressed like I am now!

08:50.950 --> 08:52.630
What are you talking about, Priecia?

08:52.630 --> 08:54.510
Let me go!

08:54.510 --> 08:55.620
Priecia...

08:55.620 --> 08:57.510
You're no different.

08:57.510 --> 09:01.520
You're the same as other men. You only judge a woman on her appearance.

09:01.520 --> 09:03.700
Instead of the real me, who fights as a knight,

09:03.700 --> 09:06.910
you prefer the unreal me who is graceful, elegant, gorgeous,

09:06.910 --> 09:09.520
loved by everyone, and above all, feminine!

09:09.520 --> 09:13.280
You only love me when I'm like a princess or a doll!

09:13.540 --> 09:15.600
Calm down, Priecia.

09:14.920 --> 09:17.630
Shut up! Don't touch me!

09:39.780 --> 09:43.180
Let's make a toast with the Blood of God.

09:45.180 --> 09:47.190
Blood of God?

09:47.640 --> 09:51.690
Let's use that sharp scythe to harvest all the grapes on this land.

09:52.790 --> 09:55.950
The fruit has ripened, and the time to reap it has come.

09:56.270 --> 09:57.590
It ends tonight.

10:05.800 --> 10:07.750
Hyaweh.

10:10.100 --> 10:13.080
do you remember that I had something to tell you?

10:13.080 --> 10:16.690
Yes, and I still hope to hear it from you.

10:18.280 --> 10:20.960
I... feel scared.

10:22.010 --> 10:25.990
That if I tell you, our relationship...

10:25.990 --> 10:29.120
and all the time we shared together...

10:29.120 --> 10:31.030
will feel like a lie.

10:35.920 --> 10:37.870
Believe me, Priecia,

10:37.870 --> 10:39.780
no matter what you tell me,

10:40.220 --> 10:43.400
I'll never let go of your hand.

10:43.400 --> 10:46.680
Everything will be fine. You're not alone any more.

10:47.610 --> 10:48.710
Yes.

10:52.590 --> 10:55.440
Good luck, Lady Priecia.

10:57.890 --> 10:59.220
Hear me out.

10:59.220 --> 11:04.100
You're the only one whom I want to know about this.

11:04.490 --> 11:06.850
This is the secret behind my birth.

11:07.390 --> 11:09.510
My real name is...

11:09.510 --> 11:12.610
Priecia Von Rosenberg.

11:12.610 --> 11:15.610
Rosenberg? Does that mean...

11:15.960 --> 11:19.430
My father's name is Kizarov Von Rosenberg.

11:19.430 --> 11:21.610
In accordance with my father's orders,

11:21.610 --> 11:26.390
I was raised as a replacement for the missing princess.

11:27.250 --> 11:28.730
I'm just a stand-in.

11:30.220 --> 11:31.360
Why?

11:31.360 --> 11:35.380
Why do you want to raid Rosenberg Castle tonight?

11:35.380 --> 11:40.090
Hyaweh is the much-sought royal descendant who possesses the Blood of God.

11:40.090 --> 11:43.140
Now that you've found him, isn't that enough?

11:43.630 --> 11:46.140
Please reconsider this course of action, Sir Judas.

11:46.390 --> 11:50.030
Destroying the balance of power that Gerot has created

11:50.030 --> 11:54.650
will force our plans to be immeasurably altered.

11:54.980 --> 11:57.910
I'm aware of the impertinence of what I'm about to say, but...

11:57.910 --> 12:01.400
this action constitutes a betrayal of our Lords.

12:01.400 --> 12:05.260
Ms. Litte, Lord Gerot, Viella...

12:05.260 --> 12:10.040
Oh, Aruke! What is this, I don't even
get what's going on anymore...

12:13.400 --> 12:17.000
It all started with the Tragedy of the Blue Moon.

12:17.320 --> 12:22.400
The king, the queen and the princess all went missing at once.

12:22.400 --> 12:25.640
Essentially, it was a ruinous event for the kingdom.

12:25.640 --> 12:30.110
So, Father raised me to be a stand-in for the princess.

12:30.110 --> 12:34.250
As long as there are rumors saying that the missing princess is still alive,

12:34.250 --> 12:37.770
there will be a deterrent for the neighboring countries that want to attack us.

12:37.770 --> 12:41.350
It also gives us a chance to track down dangerous individuals within the country.

12:42.200 --> 12:45.160
That's what my duty is.

12:45.160 --> 12:47.460
Thank you for telling me this.

12:48.220 --> 12:50.910
Still, should I really be in on such a big secret?

12:50.910 --> 12:53.400
Yes, because I can trust you.

12:53.400 --> 12:56.630
This way, I'll finally be able to...

12:56.630 --> 12:59.210
break up with you with no regrets.

13:00.380 --> 13:06.220
At tonight's feast, I'll officially proclaim myself the next Queen of Windland.

13:06.220 --> 13:09.660
Even though I'll only be filling in for the real queen,

13:09.660 --> 13:15.230
I have to bring hope to our anxious populace, which has almost lost all hope.

13:15.230 --> 13:20.230
I need to make sure they don't lose their pride as Windlanders.

13:20.630 --> 13:22.380
That's why I must...

13:23.130 --> 13:25.500
say goodbye to you tonight.

13:25.500 --> 13:29.740
No matter how much you love me, the me you love...

13:29.740 --> 13:32.460
will finally disappear, for the last time.

13:34.980 --> 13:38.840
I must bring Hyaweh to Viella without fail.

13:38.840 --> 13:42.760
That's why I've brought him into the Tempelritter.

13:42.760 --> 13:46.520
In that case, why must you engage in meaningless bloodshed?

13:46.520 --> 13:50.010
Sir, a spy from Sablum...

13:50.320 --> 13:53.100
seems to have been eavesdropping.

13:56.500 --> 14:00.820
My objective is not to bring down Windland, Litte.

14:00.820 --> 14:05.970
I just want to witness his divine power with my own eyes.

14:06.380 --> 14:08.410
The power of the Ark.

14:08.410 --> 14:09.900
Ah, a shooting star!

14:09.900 --> 14:10.960
There goes another one.

14:10.960 --> 14:12.040
Over there, too.

14:12.040 --> 14:12.870
And over here?!

14:12.870 --> 14:17.870
No~ This must be a sign from God
that I'll be with Hyaweh forever.

14:17.870 --> 14:21.800
I'll have to wish that Hyaweh falls in love with me.

14:21.800 --> 14:25.510
May he fall in love with me, may he fall in love with me...

14:25.060 --> 14:26.520
Give it up, Orichi.

14:26.520 --> 14:29.230
You didn't manage to become a knight or PNP.

14:29.230 --> 14:31.830
You can't succeed in love if you fail at life.

14:31.830 --> 14:34.490
Hey, Ayra, look up. What's <i>that</i>?

14:34.490 --> 14:35.890
The star is...

14:42.880 --> 14:43.650
Priecia...

14:44.130 --> 14:46.150
I love you.

14:46.610 --> 14:51.160
I love the Priecia who studied, played and fought with me.

14:51.500 --> 14:53.480
I love the Priecia who loves Windland more than anybody...

14:53.480 --> 14:56.070
and who stands up and confronts her destiny.

14:56.070 --> 14:58.360
I love the you I don't know.

14:58.360 --> 15:04.020
But above all, I love everything about the
singular girl named Priecia...

15:04.020 --> 15:06.380
who's in my arms right now.

15:06.380 --> 15:07.680
Hyaweh.

15:08.280 --> 15:13.890
Now, I clearly understand just whose knight I should become.

15:27.590 --> 15:29.200
An Angel!

15:40.470 --> 15:42.510
The castle is burning.

15:42.510 --> 15:43.950
Let's go back, Priecia!

15:43.950 --> 15:46.590
But we don't have any weapons, and our outfits aren't exactly...

15:46.590 --> 15:47.760
Lady Priecia.

15:49.310 --> 15:50.510
A change of clothes.

15:51.110 --> 15:52.510
Kagura!

15:53.510 --> 15:55.440
Where's Onii-chan?

15:55.440 --> 15:58.810
Hyaweh'll be fine. But unless we escape, we won't be!

15:58.810 --> 16:00.310
Onii-chan!!

16:00.650 --> 16:02.680
Hurry up and evacuate the noncombatants!

16:02.680 --> 16:03.620
Marquis.

16:03.620 --> 16:05.310
Karin, what's the situation?

16:05.650 --> 16:08.390
Numerous Angels have broken into the castle.

16:08.390 --> 16:11.830
In addition, they're continuing an aerial bombardment. If this continues...

16:11.830 --> 16:15.690
I understand. Right now, I just want a little more time to complete the evacuation.

16:15.690 --> 16:18.330
I'll go outside and attract the enemy's attention.

16:18.800 --> 16:21.920
You lead the students to shelter in the royal capital.

16:21.920 --> 16:25.330
I cannot allow that! You are vital to Windland.

16:25.330 --> 16:28.040
Let me distract the enemy.

16:28.040 --> 16:32.720
As a knight and a samurai, falling in battle is an honor!

16:32.720 --> 16:34.800
You're mistaken, Karin.

16:35.220 --> 16:38.070
As I acknowledge you as a true samurai,

16:38.090 --> 16:40.810
I entrust you with the task of protecting the young ones.

16:41.100 --> 16:43.490
Please survive, for their sake.

16:45.530 --> 16:48.150
I don't intend to throw my life away.

16:48.150 --> 16:51.610
Worry not. Our flame of hope...

16:51.610 --> 16:53.720
has not gone out yet.

16:54.110 --> 16:56.620
Curse you, Darkness Knight...

16:56.620 --> 17:01.120
How dare you launch a full attack on
Windland without informing me?

17:01.960 --> 17:05.000
This is why I was against the incorporation of mercenaries...

17:05.000 --> 17:07.130
of unknown origin into our country's army!

17:08.280 --> 17:11.910
If the Lords learn of this, I'll be finished.

17:11.440 --> 17:13.130
You've made a false step, Gerot.

17:13.530 --> 17:18.640
We did not lend you Angels for the purpose of executing reckless operations.

17:18.640 --> 17:24.640
I-I-I myself only just now received a
report concerning this matter, so...

17:25.300 --> 17:30.650
You hopeless fool. If the royal bloodline were to be extinguished at this point,

17:30.650 --> 17:35.960
our hopes that we've held for millennia, to cast off the flesh and become gods,

17:35.960 --> 17:38.160
would be forever shrouded in darkness.

17:38.160 --> 17:41.460
Judas, that ignorant fledgling...

17:41.460 --> 17:47.170
Why does he so insist on unleashing the power of the Ark?

17:49.100 --> 17:50.260
There's no end to this!

17:50.260 --> 17:52.730
We can't even get close to the castle.

17:52.730 --> 17:54.670
Hyaweh, Lady Priecia,

17:55.030 --> 17:57.050
allow me to handle things here.

17:57.500 --> 17:58.400
Kagura.

17:58.400 --> 17:59.550
Got it!

18:00.260 --> 18:01.780
Lady Priecia.

18:01.780 --> 18:03.350
Listen well, Kagura.

18:03.710 --> 18:06.030
Never waste your life.

18:07.210 --> 18:10.860
After this, let us all eat together.

18:10.860 --> 18:12.280
Right!

18:16.860 --> 18:19.360
You shall not pass. I won't forgive...

18:19.360 --> 18:22.300
anyone who attempts to hurt those two.

18:29.570 --> 18:31.630
What took you so long, Hyaweh?

18:32.000 --> 18:35.920
Let me witness the Blood of God and the power of that sword.

18:39.080 --> 18:43.620
Where is that brat? Where are you, brat?

18:43.620 --> 18:46.450
Oh oh~ That swordplay...

18:46.450 --> 18:50.230
After hearing Priecia's story, I had a hunch...

18:50.230 --> 18:51.690
Is it really you?

18:51.690 --> 18:52.940
Who are you?

18:52.940 --> 18:55.730
I know you've never not been stupid,

18:55.730 --> 18:59.160
but you've managed to forget me, your lifelong rival.

18:59.160 --> 19:00.700
You're pathetic, Meister!

19:01.370 --> 19:02.890
Meister?

19:03.530 --> 19:05.450
Who is that?

19:05.810 --> 19:08.010
I'm the Darkness Knight.

19:08.010 --> 19:12.670
I'm here to defeat the whelp named Hyaweh.

19:12.670 --> 19:15.740
I'll kill you, Hyaweh! I'll kill you!

19:15.740 --> 19:19.010
You're saying you intend to kill your blood relative?

19:19.010 --> 19:21.600
Your foolishness is limitless!

19:24.690 --> 19:27.770
This is not a duel. It's a rescue.

19:28.110 --> 19:31.060
Open your eyes, my friend!

19:33.870 --> 19:36.070
It's hopeless. There's too many of them!

19:36.380 --> 19:40.510
No problem. You still have one last trump card.

19:40.510 --> 19:41.430
Trump card?

19:41.430 --> 19:44.160
Yes. No matter what happens to the princess,

19:44.160 --> 19:46.920
there'll always be a knight who'll protect her!

19:46.920 --> 19:50.080
Hyaweh, are you perhaps saying that...

19:50.370 --> 19:53.020
I've made up my mind. I'll be...

19:53.020 --> 19:54.590
I'll be your very own knight.

19:55.120 --> 19:58.920
To protect you from those who would intimidate or threaten you...

19:58.920 --> 20:01.590
from those who would sadden you, and everything else.

20:01.940 --> 20:05.830
In the name of the sun that rules over the day, and the moon that protects the night,

20:05.830 --> 20:09.600
I swear to protect you until the end of my life.

20:10.200 --> 20:12.100
I swear on this sword.

20:12.400 --> 20:16.050
Very well! I leave my life in your hands!

20:16.050 --> 20:17.930
I'm honored to accept it!

20:21.340 --> 20:24.660
Situation critical. MEGIDO activated.

21:07.200 --> 21:09.660
The sword has changed into white feathers.

21:09.660 --> 21:13.660
The heavenly flames that sear away the impurities of the world.

21:13.660 --> 21:16.450
This... This is the legendary...

21:16.450 --> 21:19.920
MEGIDO Flame, which once scorched this land.

21:22.780 --> 21:24.430
Lady Priecia.

21:29.350 --> 21:30.930
Onii-chan.

21:32.270 --> 21:34.440
Look, Meister.

21:34.760 --> 21:37.440
This is the flame of our hope.

21:47.950 --> 21:49.950
<i>My knight?</i>

21:49.950 --> 21:54.350
<i>It seems that he hasn't broken his habit of forcefully grasping others' hands. </i>

21:54.350 --> 21:55.420
<i>However,</i>

21:55.960 --> 21:58.230
<i>as long as he doesn't let go of my hand,</i>

21:58.230 --> 22:01.710
<i>I feel that Hyaweh and I can go anywhere together.</i>

22:03.030 --> 22:09.690
The discomforting pain is linked with these two hands.

22:09.690 --> 22:16.170
This hope I shouldn't have, that a map will come to me.

22:16.170 --> 22:22.950
The promised place still hasn't been forgotten.

22:22.950 --> 22:29.840
If it's the song played in the heart then it'll definitely come across.

22:29.840 --> 22:36.690
That's why now I will believe the dream will come true.

22:37.210 --> 22:44.730
Even though, you will painfully lose the love that enveloped you.

22:44.730 --> 22:51.370
That everlasting dream will strengthen and change.

22:51.370 --> 22:58.530
Spread your wings and aim for the sky.

23:04.750 --> 23:09.200
<i>An end of one battle is only followed by...</i>

23:09.200 --> 23:11.930
<i>the beginning of another battle.</i>

23:20.300 --> 23:24.490
<i>When the time comes that you open your eyes again,</i>

23:24.940 --> 23:27.880
<i>I want you to fulfill your promise to me.</i>

23:27.880 --> 23:29.990
<i>However, at least for now...</i>

23:30.500 --> 23:34.000
<i>I should let you be with your loved one. Rest well, you two.</i>

23:34.910 --> 23:36.830
<i>Priecia...</i>
